{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>If to call you.</b> If the calling is for your own sake, and you think to take a fee for it — <b>arise, go with them.</b>" "<b>But only.</b> Against your will — <b>only the word that I speak to you, that shall you do.</b> And even so, וַיֵּלֶךְ בִּלְעָם — he said: perhaps I will persuade Him and He will relent."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:12.919498911Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}